---
title: "One unattended role run"
---
graph TB
  KonyklabsRoadmapClock@{ shape: rectangle, label: "roles.yml" }
  subgraph KonyklabsDotgithubRoleJob["`role-job.yml`"]
    KonyklabsDotgithubRoleJob.Propose@{ shape: rectangle, label: "propose" }
    KonyklabsDotgithubRoleJob.ApplyJob@{ shape: rectangle, label: "apply" }
  end
  KonyklabsDotgithubDeliveryManager@{ shape: rectangle, label: "delivery-manager" }
  Anthropic@{ shape: rectangle, label: "Anthropic" }
  KonyklabsDotgithubRegistry@{ shape: disk, label: "roles/registry.json" }
  KonyklabsRoadmapIssues@{ shape: cylinder, label: "issues" }
  KonyklabsDotgithubHeartbeat@{ shape: rectangle, label: "role-heartbeat.yml" }
  Github@{ shape: rectangle, label: "GitHub" }
  KonyklabsRoadmapClock -. "`cron fires, if ROLES_ENABLED`" .-> KonyklabsDotgithubRoleJob
  KonyklabsDotgithubDeliveryManager -. "`charter + run brief, concatenated`" .-> KonyklabsDotgithubRoleJob.Propose
  KonyklabsDotgithubRoleJob.Propose -. "`read scopes only — no scope here can 
write`" .-> Anthropic
  KonyklabsDotgithubRoleJob.Propose -. "`JSON proposal, with a surveyed count`" .-> KonyklabsDotgithubRoleJob.ApplyJob
  KonyklabsDotgithubRoleJob.ApplyJob -. "`caps, scope, context — all checks before 
the first write`" .-> KonyklabsDotgithubRegistry
  KonyklabsDotgithubRoleJob.ApplyJob -. "`applies, or applies nothing at all`" .-> KonyklabsRoadmapIssues
  KonyklabsDotgithubHeartbeat -. "`Friday: is role/dm-flow-sweep in the run 
history?`" .-> Github
  KonyklabsDotgithubHeartbeat -. "`opens an issue if it is not`" .-> KonyklabsRoadmapIssues
